              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "KuNkulunkulu ohlakaniphileyo yedwa, kakube ludumo ngoJesu Kristu kuze kube nininini. Amen. (Yabhalelwa amaRoma ivela eKorinte, yathunyelwa nguFebe inceku yebandla laseKenikreya.)",
